    {
      "source": "The created <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> contains all request parameter name/value pairs,\nor all multipart files for a given parameter name if specifically declared\nwith <a href=\"../../multipart/MultipartFile.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.multipart\"><code>MultipartFile</code></a> as the value type. If the method parameter type is\n<a href=\"../../../util/MultiValueMap.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>MultiValueMap</code></a> instead, the created map contains all request parameters\nand all their values for cases where request parameters have multiple values\n(or multiple multipart files of the same name).",
      "translation": "创建的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 包含所有请求参数名称/值对，或者如果明确声明使用 <a href=\"../../multipart/MultipartFile.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.multipart\"><code>MultipartFile</code></a> 作为值类型，则包含给定参数名称的所有多部分文件。如果方法参数类型为 <a href=\"../../../util/MultiValueMap.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>MultiValueMap</code></a>，则创建的 map 包含所有请求参数及其值，适用于请求参数具有多个值（或具有相同名称的多个多部分文件）的情况。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the given <a href=\"../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">method parameter</a> is\nsupported by this resolver.",
      "translation": "给定<a href=\"../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">方法参数</a>是否由该解析器支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a method parameter into an argument value from a given request.\nA <a href=\"../support/ModelAndViewContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>ModelAndViewContainer</code></a> provides access to the model for the\nrequest. A <a href=\"../../bind/support/WebDataBinderFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.bind.support\"><code>WebDataBinderFactory</code></a> provides a way to create\na <a href=\"../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> instance when needed for data binding and\ntype conversion purposes.",
      "translation": "将方法参数解析为来自给定请求的参数值。`<a href=\"../support/ModelAndViewContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.support\"><code>ModelAndViewContainer</code></a>` 提供对请求模型的访问。`<a href=\"../../bind/support/WebDataBinderFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.bind.support\"><code>WebDataBinderFactory</code></a>` 提供了一种在需要数据绑定和类型转换时创建 `<a href=\"../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a>` 实例的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
