      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#resolveArgument(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest,org.springframework.web.bind.support.WebDataBinderFactory)\">resolveArgument</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodArgumentResolver</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter to resolve. This parameter must\nhave previously been passed to <a href=\"../support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must\nhave returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 要解析的方法参数。此参数必须先前已传递给<a href=\"../support/HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html#supportsParameter(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodArgumentResolver.supportsParameter(MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该调用必须返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>binderFactory</code> - a factory for creating <a href=\"../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> instances",
      "translation": "<code>binderFactory</code> - 用于创建 <a href=\"../../bind/WebDataBinder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.bind\"><code>WebDataBinder</code></a> 实例的工厂",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
